[[File:Ficus Licker (Beta 43.0).png|thumb|208x208px|Beta 43.0]]
Ficus Licker was added in '''Beta 39.1''' as a 2G 1/3 [https://undercards.fandom.com/wiki/Category:Common Common] monster (to show its role as [https://undercards.fandom.com/wiki/Gaster_Follower_1 G Follower 1]'s "real" version) with the Magic ability to give +1 Thorns to an ally monster. It also has 1 Thorn(s) itself. '''Beta 43.0''' gave both itself and its Magic 1 more Thorn(s).
[[File:Ficus Licker (Beta 49.0).png|thumb|206x206px|Beta 49.0]]
'''Beta 49.0''' reworked it into a 2/2/2 [https://undercards.fandom.com/wiki/Category:Basic Basic/Base] monster, giving it the Magic of simply drawing a card. (This makes it more on par with GF1 again after the [https://undercards.fandom.com/wiki/Category:Follower Follower] redesign of Beta 46.0.) '''Beta 51.0''' returned it to a Common, made it count as a [https://undercards.fandom.com/wiki/Category:Plant Plant] and is now limited to drawing a Plant.

